": "Second or Subsequent Offence: If committed within three years, the fine increases to ₹15,000 and/or imprisonment for up to 2 years .", "reference_indexes": [2, 3]}, {"snippet": "Additional Consequences: Traffic police can seize your vehicle, suspend your driving licence for 3 to 6 months, and auto insurance claims are completely denied if an accident occurs under the influence."}], "reference_indexes": [3, 4, 5]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "Would you like to know how to check or pay a pending traffic challan online through the official Parivahan Portal?"}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "Drink and Drive Challan & Fine in Delhi in 2026", "link": "https://www.godigit.com/traffic-rules/drink-and-drive-fine-in-delhi", "snippet": "Drink and Drive Challan & Fine Amount in Delhi 2026 * Drink and Drive Challan & Fine Amount in Delhi 2026. According to an Economic Times report, there are about 1...", "source": "Digit Insurance", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.godigit.com&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR0_dTsbobNKpbVPkSVlHe3_vBbrbh1pPAtBZQIDT0XP65k8zaBoRMnQ1CkBmKZTz28Jwxq4LvvCykS7vei-rrKtdk"}, {"index": 1, "title": "Punishment for Drunk Driving and Killing Someone in India", "link": "https://lawbhoomi.com/punishment-for-drunk-driving-and-killing-someone-in-india/", "snippet": "What about Drunk Driving Offence Laws in India? Currently, driving under the influence is considered a criminal offence in India under Section 185 of the Motor Veh...", "source": "LawBhoomi", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://lawbhoomi.com&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS0JXAfu_LJXrP3H8mUi9VOerlSVqdzfXu8UMiCNedmBOFLrmbnIhRPrrmBrvFmIcYP35JAtOtrPjL7UPE9g_eA31KubVEf0fNXe_is"}, {"index": 2, "title": "Drink and